We've asked in the past, and you responded.  This time it's 
even more urgent:  we need your help in discovering the bugs in
Pathlevel 7 NetHack.

Pl7 contained a large amount of new code, and despite our vigil
it probably also contains new bugs.  We need to flush them out.

Pl8 is not too far off.  It will contain a more advanced version 
of the PC overlay, touch-ups to the Amiga and Mac ports, and bug 
fixes.  It will NOT contain new code, except as required for
the implementation of the items mentioned.  Pl8 will be the last 
official 3.0 Patch, and with it we hope to eliminate as many bugs 
from the game as you and us can discover.

So, once more you are asked to help in the bug hunt.  If you
discover a bug, please post your discovery here (so that other will
know that the bug in question is in the open) AND mail us a copy. 
If you had a core dumped and your binary is not stripped, please 
use debug tools (dbx, adb, or whatever) to extract as much info as
possible.  Thank you all.

For the Development Team,

-Izchak


